### 測試一：下單邏輯與運費計算 (確認後端會不會「自己算錢」以及「自動建立物流資訊」)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "SellerID": 15,
  "BuyerName": "真實連線測試",
  "BuyerPhone": "0912345678",
  "BuyerEmail": "seller@test.com",
  "BuyerAddress": "資管系實驗室",
  "ShippingMethod": "超取",
  "items": [
    {
      "ProductID": 30,
      "Quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 測試二：取消訂單 (模擬庫存回補)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/orders/70001/cancel

