### 以下是你原本舊有的測試案例

### 舊測試：結帳計算
POST http://localhost:3000/api/checkout/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartItems": [
    { "productId": -1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 舊測試：追蹤 API
POST http://localhost:3000/api/track/view
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 2001,
  "pageType": "Product",
  "referrer": "facebook.com"
}

### 舊測試：後台分析
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/analytics